# The list with art on Recent, whose games are of different consoles and
# have no art: DOWN from a GB game to a GBA game swaps the drawn GB box for
# the GBA one with no cover between (every frame hashed), and DOWN to the
# next GBA game keeps it.
#! settings 28=1 31=1
#! sd-file /Zelda.gb 32768 /dev/null
#! sd-file /torii/recent.txt 0 tests/shots/data/recent-mixed.txt
-w "nav: home ready"
-k @8:A -k @12:-
-w "nav: page recent ready"
-s @30:gb.png
-k @32:DOWN -k @36:-
-H @32:@60
-s @60:gba.png
-k @62:DOWN -k @66:-
-s @90:gba-next.png
